<title>UK: IRAQ TENDERS TO BUY UP TO 50,000 T WHITE SUGAR.</title>
<headline>IRAQ TENDERS TO BUY UP TO 50,000 T WHITE SUGAR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq is to tender on August 15 to buy between 25,000 and 50,000 tonnes of white sugar, European trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sugar was to be French in origin, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
